    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Located on the edge of Goleen village, this charming four-bedroom cottage enjoys a private and sheltered setting, with generous lawns and a lovely picnic area providing plenty of space to relax and enjoy the outdoors.\r\nThe accommodation comprises an open-plan kitchen, dining and living area together with four bedrooms, offering comfortable and practical living space.\r\nThe location adds greatly to the appeal of this lovely home being walking distance to the village and attractions such as Barleycove Beach, Mizen Head and Crookhaven all just a short drive away.\r\n\r\nProperty features: \r\nBuilt c. 1996\r\nElectric heating (Warme designer heaters)\r\nSolid fuel stove. \r\nMains water & sewage \r\nWalled and gated entrance. \r\n\r\nProperty layout: \r\nEntrance porch: (1.26m x 1.6m) \r\nKitchen / dining: (2.5m x 5.1m) \r\nLiving area: (3.65m x 4.8m) solid fuel stove \r\nBedroom 1: (3.6m x 3m) \r\nBedroom 2: (3.6m x 3m) \r\nBathroom: (1.8m x 1.7m) bath, wc, whb \r\n\r\n1st floor: \r\nLanding area \r\nBedroom 3: (4m x 3.6m) \r\nBedroom 4: (4m x 3.9m) \r\nShower room: (2.1m x 1.7m) shower, wc, whb\r\n\r\nAll information is provided in good faith and believed to be correct; however, it is not guaranteed and should be independently verified. No representations or warranties, express or implied, are made as to the accuracy, completeness, condition, or planning status of the property.\r\nInterested parties should investigate independently as to the accuracy of all details, including measurements, boundaries, area, BER rating, and available services. In addition, all apparatus, fixtures, fittings or services should be thoroughly tested to assess their working condition.\r\nPhotographs and videos are for guidance purposes only and may show items (such as furniture) that are not included in the sale unless specifically agreed between the parties."
